{"id":"H6271","lemma":"עֲתַלְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"atalyah","sayIt":"a-tal-yah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Athaliah","meaning":"A queen living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Ki.8.26;\ndaughter of: Ahab (H0256);\nsister of: Joash (H3101H), Ahaziah (H0274) and Joram (H3141H); married to Jehoram (H3088);\nmother of: Ahaziah (H0274H) and Jehosheba (H3089)\n§ Athaliah = \"afflicted of the Lord\"\n1) son of Jeroham of the tribe of Benjamin\n2) father of Jeshaiah of the sons of Elam who was one of the heads of a family who returned with Ezra from exile\n3) the daughter of Ahab and Jezebel and the wife of king Jehoram of Judah; killer of all the members of the royal family of Judah with the exception of one baby named Joash who was hidden by the high priest Jehoiada until 6 years had passed and Jehoiada led the revolution to put him on the throne, overthrowing Athaliah and putting her to death","glosses":["athaliah","when athaliah","while athaliah","then athaliah","because athaliah","that"],"count":17,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2ki-8","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Athaliah","kjv":"was Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-11","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"When Athaliah","kjv":"And when Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-11","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Athaliah","kjv":"Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-11","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"while Athaliah","kjv":"And Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-11","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"When Athaliah","kjv":"And when Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-11","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Athaliah","kjv":"and Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-11","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"because Athaliah","kjv":"Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Athaliah","kjv":"and Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-22","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Athaliah","kjv":"also was Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-22","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"When Athaliah","kjv":"But when Athaliah"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-22","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"t